# Polliwallop's affinity for Frogs counts only Frogs its caster controls (CR 702.41a). Bot1 controls a non-Frog (Alpine Grizzly) and Bot2 a Frog
# (Poison Dart Frog), so the spell costs its full {3}{G}: all four Moxen are tapped for it, and
# the pool is empty after the cast (a reduction would leave mana in it). Alpine Grizzly (power 4) deals twice that, 8, to Bot2's Frog, which dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Alpine Grizzly
Polliwallop
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Poison Dart Frog
Island x17

